---
import LandingPage from "../layouts/LandingPage.astro";
---

<LandingPage
	title="Privacy Policy | Luna"
	description="Simple privacy policy overview for Luna, including references to Kodelab privacy practices."
	locale="en"
>
	<section class="py-16 sm:py-20">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base text-gray-600">
				This Privacy Policy explains how Luna collects, uses, and protects personal data when you use the
				service.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-gray-700">
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Data we collect</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						We may process account details, organization and workforce scheduling data, and service usage
						metadata needed to provide and secure Luna.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">2. How we use data</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						Data is used to operate the platform, manage access, support users, improve product
						performance, and meet legal obligations.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">3. Data sharing</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						We do not sell personal data. Data may be shared with trusted service providers that support
						platform operations, under appropriate contractual and security controls.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">4. Security and retention</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						We apply reasonable technical and organizational safeguards and retain data only for as long as
						necessary for service delivery, compliance, and legitimate business purposes.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">5. Your rights</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict
						processing of your personal data, as well as the right to object or request data portability.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">6. Kodelab privacy policy</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						Luna is provided by Kodelab. For additional details on privacy practices and legal information,
						please review Kodelab's full privacy policy:
						<a
							class="text-luna-600 hover:text-luna-700 underline"
							href="https://kodelab.hr/privacy-policy/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							https://kodelab.hr/privacy-policy/
						</a>
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">7. Contact</h2>
					<p class="mt-2">
						For privacy-related questions, contact us at
						<a class="text-luna-600 hover:text-luna-700 underline" href="mailto:hello@kodelab.hr"
							>hello@kodelab.hr</a
						>.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</LandingPage>
